# A scooter wheelie and the ditch (physics phase 31): up to speed on a Vantage scooter, up then down
# quickly lifts the front (Scooter Wheelie: the manual's balance on up and down while the motor runs; the
# balance bot holds it), then ollie: the rider pops off its side onto the board, twisting off its line at a
# drawn spin (this seed: 3.2 rad/s left), and lands it clean: Scooter Wheelie + Scooter Ditch, 1,010. The
# scooter lies on its side where it was left; jumping off it is no CAR HOP.
park sf
seed 7
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 358.9 323.7 -1.08 45
tap use 30
hold up 40..398
tap up 400
tap down 406
bot balance
tap ollie 700
run 1000
expect event vehicleEnter{name=vantage_1,type=scooter} within 30..32
expect event manualStart{trick=Scooter Wheelie} within 405..409
expect state drive at 600
expect event manualEnd{trick=Scooter Wheelie,reason=ollie} within 699..703
expect event scooterDitch within 699..703
expect event vehicleExit{name=vantage_1} within 699..703
expect event land{quality=clean} within 811..815
expect event comboLanded{name=Scooter Wheelie + Scooter Ditch,points=1010} within 822..826
expect van.car.drive.ride.tipped == 1 at 900
expect van.hspeed < 0.01 at 900
expect no event gap{id=car_hop}
expect no event carLand
expect no event bail
